{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1513076-using-your-goblin-markets-and-how-to-get-your-players-into-them","id":1513076,"title":"Using your Goblin Markets, and how to get your players into them","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-28T07:48:48-07:00","id":1513076,"title":"Using your Goblin Markets, and how to get your players into them","content":"Earlier in the yea I was involved in a Changeling: the Lost game where the storyteller expressed a wish for their players to interact with Goblin Markets more. A fair desire, but the way they went about it was making it so any Contract learned either had to come from a Changeling <i>or</i> or from the Market itself, with the exceptions being ones learned at character creation (and the hobs outside of the market having no Contracts to give, bizarrely). This hasn't sat well with me for numerous reasons (which I will not get into here), but it has made me curious in how the people here have used their Goblin Markets, and how they encouraged players to come into them.<br /> <br /> Though I've yet to use it myself, the idea I had for an enticing Goblin Market was for it to be utilized to help solve a mystery. Secrets can be found all over the place in the mundane realm and the Hedge, but hints to them tend to accumulate in the hands of Goblins, either from memories or information sold to them or whispers that they have snatched away. A market could serve as a nice way to sell hints/directions to players to search if they run into any dead ends, or to even find something worth their time, and an opportunity to look for other things that would take a while to get normally. I even have a smoky bar sort of aesthetic in mind for it, in the style of a noir information network of sorts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}